> I've just cleared the castle for the first time, and was wondering what goes
> into an ascension kit for a wizard? Is there a good weapon for hard, magic
> resistant things?[1] Are there things beyond the obvious weapons / armour that
> are particularly handy?

Magicbane is a good general weapon to wear because it protects against
malignant-aura type curses, the kind that randomly curse items in your
inventory.  If you've received Vorpal Blade, then that can be a good
weapon to switch to for harder demons, because of the chance for
instant kill.  The finger of death spell, however, will be your savior
in many situations (Wizard of Yendor, priests, etc)

