My personal suggestions for the castle wishes, unless you have them
already: get a pair of speed boots, silver dragon scale mail, helm of
brilliance, and/or gauntlets of dexterity.  Another option could be an
amulet of life saving, in case anything stupid happens on your way
down.  If you've got all the equipment you need, a magic marker might
be useful to write up more scrolls of enchant armor, genocide, etc.

